OL,3,GNEWSASex offender who abused girls
OL,4,Ajailed for 17 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA child sex offender who abused two
OL,7,Fgirls has been jailed for 17 years.
OL,9,FAdriaan Spenkelink was caught after his
OL,10,Fvictims told detectives at Suffolk
OL,11,FPolice what had happened to them.
OL,13,FThe 41-year-old, of Bulwer Road in
OL,14,FIpswich, was found guilty of seven
OL,15,Fsexual offences - including attempted
OL,16,Frape - at Ipswich Crown Court and was
OL,17,Fjailed on Friday.
OL,19,F"It is because of their bravery that
OL,20,FSpenkelink's predatory behaviour was
OL,21,Fexposed," Det Sgt Katie Leckie said of
OL,22,Fthe victims.
